{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39745","headline":"寄同年封舍人渭 · 黄滔","name":"寄同年封舍人渭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唐城接轸赴秦川，忧合懽离骤十年。\n龙颔摘珠同泳海，凤衔辉翰别升天。\n八行真迹虽收拾，四户高扃奈隔悬。\n能使丘门终始雪，莫教华发独潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}